---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Forward Design Consulting"
  description="What Forward Design Consulting collects through this site's contact form, how it's used, and what isn't collected at all."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="full">
      <div class="mv-rise" data-mv-watch>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span>Legal</span></p>
        <h1 class="display">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lede">What we collect when you reach out, what we do with it, and what we don't do at all.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="full">
      <div class="container-prose legal-content mv-rise" data-mv-watch>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: August 8, 2026</p>

        <p>
          Forward Design Consulting LLC ("we," "us") built this policy to explain, in
          plain terms, what happens to your information when you use this site. We're a
          small studio — there's no data team, no ad network, and nothing collected here
          beyond what's needed to answer your inquiry.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you fill out the contact form, we collect: your name, email address,
          company or practice name (optional), a description of your project, the type of
          project you select, and an optional target start date. That's the entire form —
          we don't collect anything else automatically.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          Submitting the form sends your information by email, via the Resend email API,
          to Forward Design Consulting's inbox. We use it to read your inquiry and reply
          with a proposal. We also send a confirmation email to the address you provided,
          so you have a record that we received it. We don't use your information for
          marketing, and we don't sell or share it with anyone outside the studio.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not use cookies, analytics, or any third-party tracking scripts.
          We can't see how you found this page, what you clicked before you got here, or
          anything about your visit beyond what you type into the contact form.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          The only outside service involved is Resend, which delivers the emails
          generated by the contact form. Resend briefly processes the content of your
          submission in order to deliver it. The site itself is hosted on Cloudflare,
          which serves the pages you're viewing now; hosting providers typically log
          basic technical data — like IP address and request timing — for security and
          reliability, separate from anything you submit through the form.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiry emails stay in our inbox like any other email, until we delete them or
          you ask us to. If you'd like your information removed, email us and we'll take
          care of it.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You're not required to fill out the contact form to browse this site. If you'd
          rather not submit your information through the form, you can reach us directly
          at <a href="mailto:fwddesignconsulting@gmail.com">fwddesignconsulting@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes, we'll update this page. Significant changes will be
          dated so you can tell what's new.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy or your information? Email
          <a href="mailto:fwddesignconsulting@gmail.com">fwddesignconsulting@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-content p.legal-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-step--2);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 60;
    font-size: var(--text-step-3);
    color: var(--color-navy);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 3rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .legal-content h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal-content p {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-fg-soft);
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-blue);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong);
  }
  .legal-content a:hover {
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }
</style>
